  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Markets</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Markets cluster works to strengthen investment readiness and mobilize finance for sustainable land use, forest protection, and inclusive climate-resilient value chains. In order to do so, we provide technical assistance, investment development hubs, and strategic partnerships to reduce investment risk, build pipelines, and connect businesses and financial institutions with funding.Through this approach, it supports projects and companies across the investment development cycle, helping turn early-stage ideas into investable opportunities while also generating system-level learning on how blended finance can catalyze long-term change.</narrative>
  </description>
